            %a{:href => "#PropertiesOfGroupActionsInTopos"} above
            these actions may be given by the classifying morphisms.
          %h4#TrivialAction Trivial action
          %p
            Consider the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%C3%A9tale+geometric+morphism"} étale geometric morphism
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
